og:4:2026-10-14 18:02:11 [http] \"GET /api/intervals/status HTTP/1.1\" 200 -\n./logs/connect-attempt.log:5:2026-10-14 18:02:19 [http] GET /api/intervals/auth/init 401 (no Authorization header)\n./logs/connect-attempt.log:6:2026-10-14 18:02:19 [http] \"GET /api/intervals/auth/init HTTP/1.1\" 401 -\n./logs/connect-attempt.log:9:    Request URL:     http://localhost:8766/api/intervals/auth/init\n./logs/connect-attempt.log:18:    http://localhost:8766/api/intervals/auth/init\n./logs/connect-attempt.log:19:https://intervals.icu/oauth/authorize?client_id=tricoach-dev&redirect_uri=http:%2F%2Flocalhost:8766%2Fapi%2Fintervals%2Fcallback&scope=ACTIVITY:READ,ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE&state=dV9va2Fmb3I6MTc5MjY4MTAwMDpiNjM1ZjBiZjU1M2ZjZWQ0YmM4ODNjMTExZmI4MDJhMw==\n./logs/connect-attempt.log:28:    Same 400 in a browser (as the signed-in athlete on intervals.icu), no\n./logs/connect-attempt.log:34:2026-09-19 17:41:03 [http] \"GET /api/intervals/callback?code=a7Jk2...&state=dV9yaXZlcmE6... HTTP/1.1\" 302 -\n./logs/connect-attempt.log:35:2026-09-19 17:41:04 [intervals] token response from https://intervals.icu/api/oauth/token:\n./logs/connect-attempt.log:37:2026-09-19 17:41:04 [intervals] u_rivera: no refresh_token in response, scheduling expiry in 3600s\n./logs/connect-attempt.log:38:2026-09-19 17:41:04 [intervals] u_rivera: connected as athlete i98765 (expires in 3600s)\n./logs/connect-attempt.log:39:2026-09-19 17:44:30 [http] \"GET /api/intervals/wellness HTTP/1.1\" 200 -\n./logs/connect-attempt.log:40:2026-09-19 18:37:12 [intervals] u_rivera: token expiry passed and no refresh token on file -> expired, reconnect\n./logs/connect-attempt.log:41:2026-09-20 07:12:48 [http] \"GET /api/intervals/status HTTP/1.1\" 200 -\n./README.md:4:plan the week; athletes see it and connect their Intervals.icu account so the\n./README.md:8:\"Connect Intervals.icu\", which runs the OAuth flow against Intervals.\n./README.md:13:`config.py` holds the OAuth client placeholders. `logs/` has what we captured\n./config.py:4:APP_SECRET = \"dev-only-change-me-7c1f0a\"          # signs the OAuth state parameter\n./config.py:6:# Intervals.icu OAuth client (placeholders; the real pair is in the deploy env)\n./config.py:7:INTERVALS_BASE = os.environ.get(\"INTERVALS_BASE\", \"https://intervals.icu\")\n./config.py:10:REDIRECT_URI = f\"http://localhost:{PORT}/api/intervals/callback\"\n./server.py:2:\"\"\"tricoach backend: sign-in, Intervals.icu OAuth connection, wellness proxy.\n./server.py:13:TOKEN_URL = config.INTERVALS_BASE + \"/api/oauth/token\"\n./server.py:14:AUTHORIZE_URL = config.INTERVALS_BASE + \"/oauth/authorize\"\n./server.py:28:    print(time.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"), \"[intervals]\", msg, flush=True)\n./server.py:50:# --- Intervals.icu calls ----------------------------------------------------\n./server.py:90:                    log(f\"{uid}: token expiry passed and no refresh token on file -> expired, reconnect\")\n./server.py:91:                    c.update(status=\"expired, reconnect\", access_token=None)\n./server.py:103:                    log(f\"{uid}: refresh failed ({e}) -> expired, reconnect\")\n./server.py:104:                    c.update(status=\"expired, reconnect\", access_token=None)\n./server.py:107:def intervals_get(conn, path):\n./server.py:167:        if url.path == \"/api/intervals/auth/init\":\n./server.py:169:        if url.path == \"/api/intervals/callback\":\n./server.py:171:        if url.path == \"/api/intervals/status\":\n./server.py:173:        if url.path == \"/api/intervals/wellness\":\n./server.py:179:        if url.path == \"/api/intervals/disconnect\":\n./server.py:188:    # Step 1: build the authorize URL and send the browser to Intervals.\n./server.py:197:    # Step 2: Intervals redirects back here with ?code=&state=.\n./server.py:231:            return self.send_json(409, {\"error\": \"intervals not connected\"})\n./server.py:233:            code, data = intervals_get(c, \"/wellness\")\n.